rendered and visually reviewed. HTML and Markdown exports preserve every
computed table and image. This ten-topic batch passes 89 scoped native cases, 21
directly instrumented ASan/UBSan cases, 95 executable public examples, 469/469
scoped documentation definitions, ten representative editor hovers and 3677
independent oracle records with 28988 checks. Frozen compatibility checks record
the intentional final-posterior RVM change. Receipts:
`build/mepml-conversion/batch-334-343/`.
